=== narrow ===

 start the docs server and a watcher


job docs $ python3 -m http.server … ✓ 1L

Both are up.


 🤖 The jobs docs and watch were stopped
    when the session last closed. Call
    job(action="start", name="docs")
    with no command to run its command
    again.



 carry on


job list ✓ 2L
job docs start ✓ 1L

Restarted docs from the command it was
remembered with.
